{title: Face to Face}
{artist: Carrie Breck & Grant Tullar}
{key: Bb}
{time: 4/4}
{tempo: 76}

Verse 1
[Bb]Face to face with Christ, my [Eb]Savior, [F]face to face — what will it [Bb]be
when with rapture I be[Eb]hold him, [F]Jesus Christ who died for [Bb]me?

Chorus
[Bb]Face to face I shall be[Eb]hold him, [F]far beyond the starry [Bb]sky;
face to face in all his [Eb]glory, [F]I shall see him by and [Bb]by!
